r=r_{1}+r_{2}+r_{3}=3+\mathrm{i}+(\sqrt{2}+\sqrt{2} \mathrm{i})=(3+\sqrt{2})+(1+\sqrt{2}) \mathrm{i}=x+y \mathrm{i} \\
|r|=\sqrt{(3+\sqrt{2})^{2}+(1+\sqrt{2})^{2}} \approx 5.03, \theta=\arctan \frac{y}{x}=\arctan \frac{1+\sqrt{2}}{3+\sqrt{2}} \approx 28^{\circ} 40^{\prime}
